*   Description   : Replaces the 2025-07-16 inventory's text tabs with     *
*                   renewal tab_pri_01..04 images, reserves the final item *
*                   row, and draws an expanded live Zeny/weight panel using*
*                   icon_weight.bmp. Weight color matches the stock       *
*                   warning threshold, and tab balloons stay beside each  *
*                   hovered vertical tab. This is a QJS-only static patch.*
